# @seazn/engine is `npm:@onryde/seazn-engine@^1.0.0`, served by GitHub Packages (engine split 2b).
# No credential in this file, ever. It is committed, and `COPY . .` puts it in the image's builder layer. pnpm 10.34 also
# refuses to expand ${...} in a project .npmrc's auth lines ("Ignored project-level auth setting"). The
# //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken line belongs in a USER-level npmrc: ~/.npmrc for local dev, the BuildKit secret for
# Docker (see Dockerfile). Pinned by scripts/__tests__/registry-install.test.ts.
@onryde:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
